---
import SectionBlock from "../SectionBlock.astro";
---

<SectionBlock
  id="agents"
  eyebrow="For agents & tools"
  title="Machine-readable by default."
  description="All standards, clauses, mechanisms, findings, and evidence packs ship as versioned, machine-readable objects with stable IDs."
>
  <div class="agents__example">
    <p class="muted">
      Example object payloads are designed for direct ingestion by governance
      tooling.
    </p>
    <pre
      class="code-block">{`{
  "id": "finding:std-02-043",
  "title": "Missing contestability path",
  "severity": "high",
  "evidence": ["ticket:REV-204", "pack:recourse-v1"],
  "remediation": "mechanism:appeals-pathway"
}`}</pre>
  </div>
  <ul class="card__list">
    <li>
      <a href="/api">Reference API</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/api#objects">Object model</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/agents/spec">Agent Safety Object Model</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/api/releases.json">Releases</a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</SectionBlock>
